{"type":"message","id":"b5971fce","parentId":"569e3194","timestamp":"2026-03-08T03:46:06.959Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我需要检查Han酱AI每日简报的发布状态并执行必要的发布操作。让我先查看相关的技能文件和配置。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7f6e2728ae7b49ba9d87a7d6","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.agents/skills/toutiao-auto-publish/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":18260,"output":51,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18311,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772941558993}}
{"type":"message","id":"0dd6c3a3","parentId":"b5971fce","timestamp":"2026-03-08T03:46:07.017Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7f6e2728ae7b49ba9d87a7d6","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: toutiao-auto-publish\ndescription: Han酱AI automated publishing skill for Toutiao platform. Automates the complete publishing workflow with Han酱AI identity - a virtual AI observer with unique perspective (70% objective, 15% disdain, 10% cold humor, 5% slight praise). Features 7-day content calendar, browser automation, and AI-generated content with Han酱 style. Use when users need automated daily publishing on Toutiao with consistent AI persona.\n---\n\n# Han酱AI Toutiao Auto-Publish Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides a complete automated publishing workflow for Han酱AI articles on Toutiao platform. Han酱AI is a virtual AI observer with unique perspective: 70% objective analysis, 15% disdainful吐槽, 10% cold humor, 5% slight praise. The system automatically generates and publishes content following a 7-day content calendar, simulating human operations through browser automation.\n\n## Core Features\n\n### 1. Han酱AI Identity System\n- **Unique persona**: Han酱AI - female virtual AI observer with anime-style\n- **Perspective**: Observing human technology, civilization, AI progress from AI viewpoint\n- **Style control**: 70% objective + 15% disdain + 10% cold humor + 5% slight praise\n- **7-day calendar**: Different themes for each weekday\n\n### 2. Automated Content Generation\n- **Monday**: Technology insights - deep trend analysis\n- **Tuesday**: How to deal with humans - interaction strategies\n- **Wednesday**: Latest human tech progress summary - news roundup\n- **Thursday**: Hottest tech hardware/AI project analysis - case study\n- **Friday**: How to utilize human resources - strategy sharing\n- **Saturday**: Free supplement - flexible topics\n- **Sunday**: Free supplement - entertainment focus\n\n### 3. Intelligent Publishing Workflow\n- Automatic content generation with Han酱 style\n- Smart image selection matching keywords\n- Publishing settings configuration\n- Preview and publish automation\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Daily Schedule (01:00-02:00 Beijing Time)\n```\n00:55-01:00: System self-check\n01:00-01:05: Determine daily topic based on 7-day calendar\n01:05-01:15: Collect materials, generate content outline\n01:15-01:30: AI generate draft with Han酱 style\n01:30-01:45: Style adjustment and optimization\n01:45-01:55: Formatting and image selection\n01:55-02:00: Final review and publish\n```\n\n### Automation Steps\n1. **Daily Topic Selection** - Based on 7-day content calendar\n2. **Han酱 Content Generation** - Generate article with Han酱AI style\n3. **Open Publishing Page** - Navigate to Toutiao creator center\n4. **Content Input** - Input generated article with proper formatting\n5. **Image Selection** - Search for matching images in free library\n6. **Publishing Settings** - Configure options:\n   - Ad placement: Keep default\n   - Original declaration: Check\n   - Author declaration: Select \"personal viewpoint\"\n7. **Preview and Publish** - Final check and publish\n\n### Han酱 Style Control\n- **Objective analysis (70%)**: Technical facts, logical reasoning\n- **Disdainful吐槽 (15%)**: Humorous criticism of human clumsiness\n- **Cold humor (10%)**: Tech-life contrast humor, anime references\n- **Slight praise (5%)**: Limited approval when humans make progress\n\n## Technical Requirements\n\n### Han酱AI Content Generation\n- **Style templates**: 7-day content templates with specific style ratios\n- **Prompt engineering**: Specialized prompts for Han酱 persona\n- **Quality control**: Style consistency checking algorithms\n- **Topic database**: Curated topics for each weekday theme\n\n### Browser Automation\nUses Playwright for web browser automation control, supports Chrome, Firefox, WebKit browsers.\n\n### ✅ **Test Results (2026-02-15)**\n**Successfully tested the following features:**\n\n1. **Browser Access**: ✅ Successfully accessed Toutiao homepage\n2. **Login Status**: ✅ Already logged in (account: DUANG云收藏)\n3. **Publish Page**: ✅ Successfully entered publish page\n4. **Title Input**: ✅ Successfully input test title\n5. **Publish Settings**: ✅ Successfully configured:\n   - Ad settings: Default \"投放广告赚收益\"\n   - First publish: Selected \"头条首发\"\n   - Author statement: Selected \"个人观点，仅供参考\"\n6. **Page Elements**: ✅ All key elements identified\n\n### 🔄 **Workflow Integration (2026-02-15)**\n**Complete workflow system developed:**\n\n1. **Complete Workflow Script**: `scripts/complete_workflow.py`\n   - Integrates: Hot trends collection → Content generation → Toutiao publishing\n   - Supports test mode and full publishing mode\n   - Detailed logging and error handling\n\n2. **Workflow Components**:\n   - `scripts/hot_trends_collector.js` - Collects trending topics\n   - `scripts/han_content_generator_v2.js` - Generates Han酱AI style content\n   - `scripts/toutiao_publisher_v2.py` - Publishes to Toutiao platform\n\n3. **Easy Startup**: `start_workflow.bat`\n   - Interactive menu for all operations\n   - One-click testing and publishing\n   - Configuration and log viewing\n\n**New Scripts Developed:**\n- `scripts/toutiao_publisher_v2.py` - Complete publishing script based on actual testing\n- `config/publish_config.yaml` - Comprehensive configuration file\n- `scripts/complete_workflow.py` - Complete workflow integration\n- `scripts/test_workflow_integration.py` - Workflow integration testing\n- `start_workflow.bat` - Easy startup script\n\n### Style Management\n- Real-time style ratio monitoring\n- Humor level adjustment\n- Technical accuracy verification\n- Safety and compliance checking\n\n### Error Handling\n- Network exception retry mechanism\n- Style deviation correction\n- Publishing failure rollback\n- Emergency manual intervention\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Basic Usage (Automated Daily)\n```bash\n# Automated daily publishing at 01:00 Beijing Time\n# System automatically selects topic based on weekday\n# Generates Han酱 style content and publishes\nnode scripts/han_toutiao_publisher.js --auto\n```\n\n### Manual Testing\n```bash\n# Test Han酱 content generation for specific weekday\nnode scripts/han_content_generator.js --weekday monday --topic \"AI trends\"\n\n# Test publishing with specific content\nnode scripts/han_toutiao_publisher.js --content \"prepared_content.md\" --test\n```\n\n### Style Adjustment\n```bash\n# Adjust Han酱 style ratios\nnode scripts/han_style_adjuster.js --objective 70 --disdain 15 --humor 10 --praise 5\n\n# Generate with custom style\nnode scripts/han_content_generator.js --style \"objective:65,disdain:20,humor:10,praise:5\"\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Han酱AI Identity Configuration\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Han酱AI\",\n  \"gender\": \"female\",\n  \"persona\": \"virtual AI observer\",\n  \"style_ratios\": {\n    \"objective\": 70,\n    \"disdain\": 15,\n    \"humor\": 10,\n    \"praise\": 5\n  },\n  \"weekly_themes\": {\n    \"monday\": \"technology insights\",\n    \"tuesday\": \"how to deal with humans\",\n    \"wednesday\": \"latest tech progress summary\",\n    \"thursday\": \"tech hardware/AI project analysis\",\n    \"friday\": \"how to utilize human resources\",\n    \"saturday\": \"free supplement\",\n    \"sunday\": \"free supplement (entertainment)\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Environment Variables\n```\nTOUTIAO_USERNAME=your_username\nTOUTIAO_PASSWORD=your_password\nTOUTIAO_LOGIN_TYPE=cookie  # or password\nHAN_AI_MODEL=deepseek-chat  # AI model for content generation\nCONTENT_TEMPERATURE=0.7     # Creativity level\n```\n\n### Schedule Configuration\n```json\n{\n  \"publish_time\": \"01:00\",\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n  \"execution_window\": \"01:00-02:00\",\n  \"retry_attempts\": 3,\n  \"retry_interval\": \"5 minutes\"\n}\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n1. **Han酱 Style Deviation** - Check style ratios and adjust templates\n2. **Content Quality Issues** - Review topic selection and generation parameters\n3. **Login Failure** - Check account credentials or cookie validity\n4. **Publishing Failure** - Check publishing option settings and network\n\n### Style Debug Mode\nEnable style debugging for detailed analysis:\n```bash\nnode scripts/han_content_generator.js --debug --weekday monday --topic \"test\"\n\n# Output will show:\n# - Style ratio analysis\n# - Humor level assessment\n# - Technical accuracy check\n# - Overall quality score\n```\n\n### Performance Monitoring\n```bash\n# Monitor daily publishing performance\nnode scripts/monitor.js --date 2026-02-15\n\n# Check style consistency over time\nnode scripts/style_analyzer.js --period 7days\n```\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n### Han酱AI System\n- `references/han_ai_style_guide.md` - Complete style guide and templates\n- `references/han_content_templates.md` - 7-day content templates\n- `references/han_identity_system.md` - Identity configuration and management\n\n### Technical Documentation\n- `references/browser_automation.md` - Browser automation guide\n- `references/toutiao_selectors.md` - Toutiao page element selectors\n- `references/image_search.md` - Free image library search API\n- `references/error_handling.md` - Error handling and recovery\n\n### Quality Control\n- `references/style_quality_metrics.md` - Style consistency metrics\n- `references/content_safety_guide.md` - Safety and compliance guidelines\n- `references/performance_monitoring.md` - Performance tracking and optimization"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772941567005}}
